    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting adventure in 101 Cute Playland Dogs: Find &amp; Paint! The playful pups have wandered off into the magical playland, hiding among the rides and attractions. Can you find all 101 dogs? With a beautifull hand-drawn illustration, you'll search every corner for these adorable dogs. Once you\u2019ve found them, dive into the painting mode to add your personal touch and bring everything life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/acabec816b0b708d2e17bd8d2e289615.avif?t=1741616318\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Object Fun:</strong> Search and find 101 dogs hidden in a beautifull hand-drawn illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Painting:</strong> Bring the illustration to life with a wide range of colors and painting tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy a calm and stress-free gaming experience, perfect for winding down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suitable for All Ages:</strong> A perfect game for both kids and adults, combining fun with creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/182fbe642786f0f5718bcdba510cff9d.poster.avif?t=1741616318\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/182fbe642786f0f5718bcdba510cff9d.webm?t=1741616318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/182fbe642786f0f5718bcdba510cff9d.mp4?t=1741616318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Object Mode Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find &amp; Discover:</strong> Search and find 101 dogs hidden in a beautifull hand-drawn illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hints &amp; Clues System:</strong> If you\u2019re stuck, use hints to help you locate hard-to-find dogs. The game offers a generous hint system that ensures you never get frustrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom Feature:</strong> Easily zoom in on sections of the scene to find smaller or hidden dogs, making sure no pup goes undiscovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/1a4562d351c76869cba8107f9d6dc7fe.poster.avif?t=1741616318\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/1a4562d351c76869cba8107f9d6dc7fe.webm?t=1741616318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242890/extras/1a4562d351c76869cba8107f9d6dc7fe.mp4?t=1741616318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Painting Mode Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong> The painting tools are easy to use, making it accessible for all skill levels and ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Tools and Colors:</strong> From multiple brushes, to painting bucket you have multiple tools to bring you vision to life. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Quality Resolution Hand-Drawn Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brightness Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Text</p></li></ul>",
